## Keyboard interactions

- <Kbd>↑</Kbd><Kbd>↓</Kbd> move focus between triggers without opening; <Kbd>Home</Kbd> / <Kbd>End</Kbd> jump to the ends.
- <Kbd>Enter</Kbd> and <Kbd>Space</Kbd> toggle the focused item.
